!include _style.iuml
@startuml devops-cd
!include _style.iuml
skinparam BackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam activityFontSize 18
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam ranksep 12
skinparam nodesep 14
partition "GitHub · protected Main and admission" {
  (*) --> "PR into protected Main\nRequired check: Full verification\nApproval: cloud and delivery lead\nMerge → Main push CI passes" as review $INFRA
  review --> "Exact SHA / CI run / attempt\nCheck out admitted source\naws branch policy + OIDC" as admit $INFRA
}
partition "AWS · persistent dc2-live" {
  admit -right-> "Preflight + in-place stack update\nBuild changed-owner images\nTrivy source / config identity\nECR digest + completed scan" as scan #F3E8FF
  scan --> "Journal prior owner + peer\nQuiesce / migrate / publish\nMove aliases; owner smoke\nVerify peer + quiescence" as promote $INFRA
  promote --> if "Owner promotion succeeded?" then
    -->[yes] "Adopt release; playback smoke\nUpload → done → MP4 + HLS\nSave journal + receipts" as playback $CLIENT
    playback --> (*)
  else
    -->[no] "Automatic restore attempt\nPrior aliases / worker + smoke\nRecord outcome; CD fails\nSave journal + receipts" as restore $PROC
    restore --> (*)
  endif
}
legend bottom
Manual: exact-source full CI dispatch can admit deploy/release.
Image-policy errors stop before owner promotion.
Candidates + kept images: strict. Replaced restore targets:
Trivy RETAINED_FIXABLE only; ECR policy still applies to all.
Later playback smoke fails CD, without its own restore hook.
Schema migrations are additive; restore does not downgrade.
endlegend
@enduml
